  {
   "id": "intro",
   "type": "intro",
   "heading": {
    "en": "Four diodes, no centre tap",
    "kn": "ನಾಲ್ಕು ಡಯೋಡ್‌ಗಳು, ಮಧ್ಯ-ಟ್ಯಾಪ್ ಇಲ್ಲ"
   },
   "hook": {
    "en": "Open almost any charger and you will find four diodes, or one small black block with four legs. That is a bridge rectifier, the most common rectifier in use.",
    "kn": "ಯಾವುದೇ ಚಾರ್ಜರ್ ತೆರೆದರೆ ನಾಲ್ಕು ಡಯೋಡ್‌ಗಳು ಅಥವಾ ನಾಲ್ಕು ಕಾಲಿನ ಸಣ್ಣ ಕಪ್ಪು ಬ್ಲಾಕ್ ಕಾಣುತ್ತದೆ. ಅದೇ ಸೇತುವೆ ದಿಷ್ಟಕಾರಿ, ಅತಿ ಹೆಚ್ಚು ಬಳಕೆಯ ದಿಷ್ಟಕಾರಿ."
   },
   "objectives": [
    {
     "en": "Explain the working of a bridge rectifier"
    },
    {
     "en": "State its advantages and disadvantages"
    },
    {
     "en": "Compare half-wave, centre-tap and bridge rectifiers"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Open almost any charger and you will find four diodes, or one small black block with four legs. That is a bridge rectifier, the most common rectifier in use.",
    "kn": "ಯಾವುದೇ ಚಾರ್ಜರ್ ತೆರೆದರೆ ನಾಲ್ಕು ಡಯೋಡ್‌ಗಳು ಅಥವಾ ನಾಲ್ಕು ಕಾಲಿನ ಸಣ್ಣ ಕಪ್ಪು ಬ್ಲಾಕ್ ಕಾಣುತ್ತದೆ. ಅದೇ ಸೇತುವೆ ದಿಷ್ಟಕಾರಿ, ಅತಿ ಹೆಚ್ಚು ಬಳಕೆಯ ದಿಷ್ಟಕಾರಿ."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Working of the bridge rectifier"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Four diodes form a bridge. The a.c. input is applied to one pair of opposite corners and the load is connected across the other pair. In the positive half cycle D1 and D3 conduct in series with the load; in the negative half cycle D2 and D4 conduct. In both halves the load current flows in the same direction, so the output is full-wave: $V_{dc} = 2V_m/\\pi$ and the ripple factor is 0.482, with no centre-tapped transformer."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Four diodes; two conduct in each half cycle"
    },
    {
     "en": "Full-wave output without a centre tap"
    },
    {
     "en": "Two diode drops: V_m − 1.4 V for Si"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "In a bridge rectifier, two diodes conduct in series in each half cycle, and the load current always flows the same way. We get full-wave output without a centre-tapped transformer.",
    "kn": "ಸೇತುವೆ ದಿಷ್ಟಕಾರಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಪ್ರತಿ ಅರ್ಧ ಚಕ್ರದಲ್ಲಿ ಎರಡು ಡಯೋಡ್‌ಗಳು ಸರಣಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ವಹಿಸುತ್ತವೆ; ಲೋಡ್ ಪ್ರವಾಹ ಯಾವಾಗಲೂ ಒಂದೇ ದಿಕ್ಕಿನಲ್ಲಿರುತ್ತದೆ. ಮಧ್ಯ-ಟ್ಯಾಪ್ ಇಲ್ಲದೆ ಪೂರ್ಣ-ತರಂಗ ಔಟ್‌ಪುಟ್ ಸಿಗುತ್ತದೆ."
   },
   "formula": "V_{dc} = \\frac{2(V_m - 2V_D)}{\\pi}"
  },
